§ `Residential Tenancies Regulations 1989`

-- r 5B: each limb disapplies s 30(1); an agreement with none of them does not.
#ASSERT `r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 1))
#ASSERT `r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 2))
#ASSERT `r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 3))
#ASSERT `r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 4))
#ASSERT `r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 5))
#ASSERT `r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 6))
#ASSERT NOT (`r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 7)))
#ASSERT NOT (`r 5B -- section 30(1) does not apply to` `a periodic agreement P`)
