-- agreement provides that the rent may increase.
#ASSERT `r 5CA -- applies to` (`a fixed term` "OLD" `between` "L" `and` (LIST "T1") `for` "1 Example St" `from day` (`day number` 2013 6 1) `to day` (`day number` 2015 5 31) `at weekly rent` 400)
#ASSERT NOT (`r 5CA -- applies to` (`a fixed term` "NEW" `between` "L" `and` (LIST "T1") `for` "1 Example St" `from day` (`day number` 2013 7 1) `to day` (`day number` 2015 6 30) `at weekly rent` 400))
#ASSERT NOT (`r 5CA -- applies to` `a periodic agreement P`)
-- r 5CB: the relevant events for s 31(1A), and the day before which an additional bond is not payable.
#ASSERT `r 5CB -- s 31(1AA) -- is a relevant event` (`the lessor gives the tenant a notice of increase of rent under s 30 or 31A` (`day number` 2026 3 1))
#ASSERT `r 5CB -- s 31(1AA) -- is a relevant event` `the lessor gives notice approving a request to keep a pet under s 50B(4)`
#ASSERT `r 5CB -- s 31(1AA) -- is a relevant event` `the lessor is taken to approve a request to keep a pet under s 50B(5)`
