GIVEN inc IS A BOOLEAN, prov IS A BOOLEAN, wv IS A BOOLEAN, intent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Term or arrangement`
`a term, inconsistent:` inc `, provided for:` prov `, a waiver:` wv `, with intent to evade:` intent MEANS
    `Term or arrangement` WITH
        `inconsistent with a provision of the Act`                                      IS inc
        `purports to exclude, modify or restrict the operation of the Act`             IS inc
        `provided for under the Act`                                                   IS prov
        `a purported waiver of a right conferred by or under the Act`                  IS wv
        `entered into with intent to defeat, evade or prevent the operation of the Act` IS intent

-- s 82(1)(a): a term letting the lessor raise the rent every 6 months is inconsistent with s 30(1)(b) and
-- void; a term limiting increases is "provided under this Act" (s 30(2)(b)) and stands; r 7F agreements
-- are outside s 82.
#ASSERT `s 82(1)(a) -- the term is void` (`a term, inconsistent:` TRUE `, provided for:` FALSE `, a waiver:` FALSE `, with intent to evade:` FALSE) `in` `a periodic agreement P`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 82(1)(a) -- the term is void` (`a term, inconsistent:` TRUE `, provided for:` TRUE `, a waiver:` FALSE `, with intent to evade:` FALSE) `in` `a periodic agreement P`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 82(1)(a) -- the term is void` (`a term, inconsistent:` TRUE `, provided for:` FALSE `, a waiver:` FALSE `, with intent to evade:` FALSE) `in` (`P with status` (`the status with only limb set:` 8)))
#ASSERT `s 82(1)(b) -- the waiver is void` (`a term, inconsistent:` FALSE `, provided for:` FALSE `, a waiver:` TRUE `, with intent to evade:` FALSE) `in` `a periodic agreement P`
#ASSERT `s 82(2) -- entering into it is an offence` (`a term, inconsistent:` FALSE `, provided for:` FALSE `, a waiver:` FALSE `, with intent to evade:` TRUE) `in` `a periodic agreement P`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 82(2) -- entering into it is an offence` (`a term, inconsistent:` FALSE `, provided for:` FALSE `, a waiver:` FALSE `, with intent to evade:` FALSE) `in` `a periodic agreement P`)
#ASSERT `s 82(2) -- the maximum fine` EQUALS 10000

§ `Part III Division 3 -- ss 26A and 26B`

GIVEN m IS A `Matter in s 26B(2)`, `matter day` IS A NUMBER, act IS AN `Action by the lessor`, `action day` IS A NUMBER, motivated IS A BOOLEAN, believes IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Alleged retaliation`
`after` m `on day` `matter day` `, the lessor took` act `on day` `action day` `, motivated:` motivated `, the tenant believing so:` believes MEANS
    `Alleged retaliation` WITH
        `matter`                                                            IS m
        `the matter arose on`                                               IS `matter day`
        `action`                                                            IS act
        `the action was taken on`                                           IS `action day`
        `the lessor was motivated, wholly or partly, by the matter arising` IS motivated
        `the tenant reasonably believes the action was retaliatory`         IS believes

`asking for repairs` MEANS `the tenant or a representative entity took action to enforce the tenant's rights (s 26B(2)(a))`

-- s 26A: a s 30 increase motivated by a request for repairs is retaliatory action; unmotivated, it is not.
#ASSERT `s 26A -- the lessor takes retaliatory action` (`after` `asking for repairs` `on day` 100 `, the lessor took` `an increase of the rent payable under the agreement` `on day` 110 `, motivated:` TRUE `, the tenant believing so:` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 26A -- the lessor takes retaliatory action` (`after` `asking for repairs` `on day` 100 `, the lessor took` `an increase of the rent payable under the agreement` `on day` 110 `, motivated:` FALSE `, the tenant believing so:` TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 26A -- the lessor takes retaliatory action` (`after` `an order of a competent court is in force in relation to the lessor and tenant (s 26B(2)(c))` `on day` 100 `, the lessor took` `action to terminate the agreement` `on day` 110 `, motivated:` TRUE `, the tenant believing so:` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 26A -- the lessor takes retaliatory action` (`after` `the lessor or its agent knows of a complaint about the lessor to the Commissioner or another government entity (s 26B(2)(b))` `on day` 100 `, the lessor took` `a refusal, at the end of the current agreement, to enter into a further agreement with the tenant` `on day` 110 `, motivated:` TRUE `, the tenant believing so:` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 26A -- the lessor takes retaliatory action` (`after` `asking for repairs` `on day` 100 `, the lessor took` `a notice claiming a breach, other than a failure to pay rent, and requiring it to be remedied` `on day` 110 `, motivated:` TRUE `, the tenant believing so:` TRUE)
