§ `Part V -- ss 64, 65 and 70`

GIVEN g IS A NUMBER, rc IS A NUMBER, pd IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Notice under s 64`
`a s 64 notice given on day` g `, received on day` rc `, for possession on day` pd MEANS
    `Notice under s 64` WITH `given on` IS g, `received by the tenant on` IS rc, `possession day specified` IS pd

`a s 64 notice for 1 May 2026` MEANS `a s 64 notice given on day` (`day number` 2026 3 1) `, received on day` (`day number` 2026 3 1) `, for possession on day` (`day number` 2026 5 1)
`a s 64 notice for 30 April 2026` MEANS `a s 64 notice given on day` (`day number` 2026 3 1) `, received on day` (`day number` 2026 3 1) `, for possession on day` (`day number` 2026 4 30)

