#ASSERT `s 27 -- requiring or receiving the amount is permitted` (`an amount of kind` `an option fee` `of` 100 `at weekly rent` 600 `, south:` TRUE `, the fee's fate:` (`refused Sunday 1 March, refunded on day` (`day number` 2026 3 9))) `, given the holidays` `no holidays`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 27 -- requiring or receiving the amount is permitted` (`an amount of kind` `an option fee` `of` 150 `at weekly rent` 600 `, south:` TRUE `, the fee's fate:` `the option was exercised and the fee refunded in cash or applied towards the rent`) `, given the holidays` `no holidays`)
