#ASSERT NOT (`s 27 -- requiring or receiving the amount is permitted` (`an amount of kind` `an option fee` `of` 100 `at weekly rent` 600 `, south:` TRUE `, the fee's fate:` `the option was refused and the fee refunded in another way`) `, given the holidays` `no holidays`)
#ASSERT `s 27 -- requiring or receiving the amount is permitted` (`an amount of kind` `rent` `of` 500 `at weekly rent` 500 `, south:` TRUE `, the fee's fate:` `the option was refused and the fee not refunded`) `, given the holidays` `no holidays`
#ASSERT `s 27 -- requiring or receiving the amount is permitted` (`an amount of kind` `an amount another provision of the Act authorises the lessor to require or receive` `of` 50 `at weekly rent` 500 `, south:` TRUE `, the fee's fate:` `the option was refused and the fee not refunded`) `, given the holidays` `no holidays`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 27 -- requiring or receiving the amount is permitted` (`an amount of kind` `any other amount` `of` 50 `at weekly rent` 500 `, south:` TRUE `, the fee's fate:` `the option was refused and the fee not refunded`) `, given the holidays` `no holidays`)
