#ASSERT NOT (`FK-21 reading B -- the notice` `PA's 2024 notice` `has effect under` `PA` `, given` `PA's history before its first increase` `,` (`the facts for ss 99 and 100 of` `PA`) `and the holidays` `no holidays`)
